# One check

This repository is a personal experiment. After a change, run one related test or one short run, then continue. Run a heavier check only when the user names it.

Do not block the next edit on a new probe, snapshot, evidence chain, gate list, fixture matrix, smoke table, unique baseline, traceable backup, full dry-run, hash reconciliation, or acceptance matrix. Do not rebuild a software identity, backfill sha256, or copy an acceptance record before a one-line change.

```text
User: fix the service branch in the adapter
Do: edit that branch, run that adapter test, read the error
Stop: identity chain, smoke matrix, full dry-run, hash reconciliation
```

Report an unpushed check as a local result.
